  "issue": {
    "body": "So @kennethreitz's Responder uses APISpec for generating the API schemas.\r\nThat's actually really nice, as it includes various plugins including marshmallow support etc.\r\n\r\nWe should have a [SchemaGenerator](https://www.starlette.io/schemas/) implementation that uses APISpec. I'm guess ideally it should be a third party implementation, rather than included in the main package.\r\n\r\nThis would make a great little project for a contributor to jump onto.\r\n\r\nSee also #172",
    "closed_at": "2018-11-24T15:49:03Z",
    "created_at": "2018-11-07T10:35:51Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/189",
    "number": 189,
    "state": "closed",
    "title": "Support an `APISpec` SchemaGenerator",
    "user": "lovelydinosaur"
